        DevotionalSection(
          icon: '🌱',
          heading:
              'God\'s Purpose Is Greater Than Our Present Circumstances',
          body:
              'The potter shaped each vessel according to the purpose he intended it '
              'to fulfill. Likewise, God is not simply interested in making our lives '
